{"id":"monarch","slug":"monarch","name":"君主","english":"Monarch","kind":"enemy","categoryKey":"bosses","dbKind":"reference","image":"./images/database/renders-thumb-monarch.png","description":"","parameters":[["基础生命","1,400"],["基础伤害","18"],["韧性","600"],["灵魂","30"],["最高单次伤害","18"],["速度","450"]],"tables":[{"title":"Where you fight it","columns":["WHEN","QUEST","WHERE"],"rows":[["Story quest","幽匿者之怒","峡谷"],["Dungeon boss room","End of the procedural dungeon","峡谷"]]},{"title":"Moves","columns":["移动","效果","基础伤害","类型"],"rows":[["近战 sweep","Partway through a one-second windup it drops a ring of soul shards、then swings in a narrow 30-degree arc with heavy knockback、and under 80% health a finished sweep leads straight into Calamity. Sidestep it rather than backing away、since the swing reaches farther than its other melee attacks.","18",""],["Dash strike","It winds up for about a 秒ond、then charges along a line locked in when the charge starts、dropping soul shards behind it. Sidestep once it commits instead of running ahead of it.","15",""],["Post dash melee attack","As the dash strike ends it follows up with a slash covering a 70-degree cone in front of it. Wait for that swing before you close in.","18",""],["First aerial attack combo","Calamity opens with a leap that scatters a ring of soul shards: a circle marks the landing spot、it drops there 0.8 秒onds later、chains five slashes. It can't be staggered during the sequence、so get out of the circle rather than trying to interrupt it.","6",""],["Calamity dash","The 秒ond step of Calamity is a charge with a shorter windup than its normal dash strike、about 0.7 秒onds. Dodge sideways as soon as the landing slashes end.","10",""],["Post dash attack","The Calamity dash ends in a slash that covers the whole half circle in front of it but doesn't reach far. Backing off clears it more reliably than circling around it.","10",""],["Second aerial attack combo","Calamity closes with another leap that drops soul shards along its path、a heel stomp on a marked landing circle、three more slashes、and it's stagger-immune throughout. Its hits launch you straight up.","9",""],["Shard circle","The melee sweep、the opening leap of Calamity each leave a ring of eight soul shards、at most once every 8 秒onds. The shards can't be targeted、and about five 秒onds later each fires a homing bolt that breaks on terrain、so get a wall or rock between you、the ring before they go off.","4",""],["灵魂 shard trail","Dash strikes、the 秒ond aerial combo drop up to five shards along the Monarch's path. They fire on the same delay as the ring、so a dash that misses you still sends a volley your way about five 秒onds later.","4",""],["Summon scavengers","A roar calls 2 to 3 Stalkers、1 to 2 Scavengers in at the arena's spawn points、with no more than 4 Stalkers、3 Scavengers alive at once. It comes back on a 25-second cooldown、so clear the adds between roars.","",""],["Summon clone","At 65% health or lower it summons a Monarch Echo where it stands、then moves into a dash strike. Only one echo can be out at a time、the summon has a 110-second cooldown、and the echo dies when the Monarch does.","",""],["吸血","Passive: every melee hit it lands、dashes、aerial combos included、gives back 80% of the damage dealt as health. 灵魂 shard bolts are ranged、don't heal it.","",""]]},{"title":"弱点与抗性","columns":["属性","变化"],"rows":[["灵魂伤害","-50%"]]},{"title":"原生属性（定义值）","native":true,"note":"解包表中的直接定义值；继承、难度与战力缩放另行计算。","columns":["定义","参数","数值"],"rows":[["君主","韧性","600"],["君主","生命","1400"],["君主","最小距离容差修正","50"],["君主","最大距离容差修正","50"],["君主","移动速度","450"],["君主","韧性恢复延迟","3"],["君主","韧性恢复速度","6"],["君主","灵魂伤害抗性倍率","0.5"],["君主","近战吸血系数","0.8"],["君主","灵魂产出","30"]]},{"title":"原生能力参数","native":true,"note":"保留能力的定义值与覆盖操作；未翻译的内部字段保留原名。","columns":["定义","能力","参数","数值","操作"],"rows":[["君主","FirstJumpState","最大目标距离","0","定义值"],["君主","FirstJumpState","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["君主","FirstJumpState","触发权重","100","定义值"],["君主","FirstJumpState","冷却时间","0","定义值"],["君主","FirstJumpState","激活期间允许再